D7AFFF][/dim]Schema card field jumps, numbered fields, and grouped rhythm[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]On the album Schema Card (opened from album and record notes), [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Shift+J/Shift+K step between fields and 1–9 jump straight to a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]numbered field, with a keycap showing each field's number beside [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]its name and clear space between field groups. On the bank Setup [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]card (~/bob/bank.md), Shift+J/Shift+K step between category groups [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]while digit hotkeys keep working. Every jump is pure navigation [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]that never writes, and the numbers and jumps always follow the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]order painted on screen.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]schema_card_field_jumps.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/schema_card_field_jumps.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-mu[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-mu/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Album card field navigation on one painted order[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]field-nav[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]field-nav: route the Schema Card's targets through one painted-order [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]helper shared with the body painter, add Shift+J/K field steps and 1–9 [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]field jumps with clamp-bump-announce feedback and reveal scrolling, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]retire the album digit count prefix, add shared bump/reveal helpers, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unit tests, a real-key e2e probe, and key docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Numbered field keycaps, heading rows, and group rhythm[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]field-visuals[dim] · [dim][/dim]after field-nav[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]field-visuals: paint keycaps for fields 1–9 with current-group emphasis,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]make field rows transparent headings, add dialog-scoped group spacing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and a shared label axis, add the field hint item and row accessibility, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]then check geometry and screenshots in real Obsidian and update the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bank Setup card group jumps[/bold #D7AFFF]                                   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-groups[dim] · [dim][/dim]after field-nav[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-groups: add Shift+J/K category-group jumps in the Categories tab [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]using painted order, make hotkeys match lowercase only so Shift+K stops [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]selecting Car, tint the current group label, add a footer hint, reuse [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the shared bump/reveal helpers, and add tests and docs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-mu","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-mu.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7fc23ea29a4a98f0df4000ad96713cff","started_at":"2026-11-17T20:42:53.348572+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"cf8cbb